                <div class='pip-dsk-panel-body w-full min-w-0 max-w-full break-words prose pt-6'><div class='prose 1 max-w-none'>A mass of vivid little blue flowers appear profusely over a long season. The vigorous, trailing plants are the perfect choice for container and basket displays.<br>Winner of an RHS Award of Garden Merit for reliability and good performance.<br>Part of the seed range produced by Mr Fothergill’s Seeds in partnership with the RHS.</div></div>
